# mp-economy: town 005's item shop (map 0xBA, slot 3) sells Mental Gum for 1000.
# Jian takes his room's door with the destination pinned to map 0xBA, then the field state is set to
# 0x68 (open shop, as a shop NPC's script request does) with shop slot 3.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B77EC 0xBA
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
poke u32 0x020B4824 5000
shot sh_town
poke u16 0x020B7838 3
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x68
wait 120
shot sh_open
press A 8
wait 60
shot sh_buy
peek u8 0x0213BA45 gum_before
press Right 8
wait 30
shot sh_gum
press A 8
wait 60
shot sh_qty
press A 8
wait 60
shot sh_confirm
press A 8
wait 90
shot sh_bought
peek u32 0x020B4824 silver_after
peek u8 0x0213BA45 gum_after
